{
  "id": "1SA.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samweli 10",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahene yaho Samweli yavugula ijuba ya maguta ga muzeituni naazuka ku mutwi gwa Saolo kandi naamuvusa, kandi navoora, “Yahova akuvakaa maguta kuli mwamihi wa vandu veve Isiraeli. Ulamiha vandu veve na uvakingi kutura ku vasigu vaavo. Na yiki kilava kimanyiru ku ivi ndi Yahova umali kokotovolo kuva mwami wa vandu veve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa kwavukana kalunu, ulagaana na vasaza vaviri ahimbi ni kilindwa cha Raheli ha Zeliza, mu kivala cha Benjamini. Valakovolera ndi zibunda zia weenyangi zimali konyoleka, kunangwa baba woovo siazihenderaa mwoyo kandi mba, navuzwa ivi; kandi nazizagilira koteeva, ‘Ngola ki ku muyaayi wange?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulazizagilira kutura ahene yaho kuduuka lwa uzaa ku musaala mutakatifu ha Taba, aha nuwaagane na vasaza vavaga nivaziizaa kuhaana vihaanwa viavo ku Nyasaye ha Bezeli mulala kuvo naave niyimiliyi vimeme vivaga vie zimburi, na wundi nagingi migadi jivaga na wakavaga naave naveeye niimuuya ye kesero ni yizuuyi iwaini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Valakucheliza na vakohe migadi giviri ku migadi zana; na ivi ulajivugilira kutura kuvo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahene yaho ulazia ku kiguru cha Nyasaye mu Gibea, wa vandu va Filisitia vasoosa. Ha vwingiliru vwi lidaala, ulavugaana nu muganda gwa vaporofeti nivasulunguta kutura ku vwali ku kiguru, nivakubaa uvukana, zindumba, amarere na madungu. Valava nivavinaa kandi nivaporofetaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonoho Roho wa Yahova alaza ku ivi ni zinguru, na ivi ulaporofeta harara navo, kandi ulagirung'anywa kugwa umundu wu lugano lundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwi vilolekizu yivi vikoleka, okole choosi cha Nyasaye akwimilira okole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulimila imbiri wange kuzia mu lidaala lia Giligali, uwa na kwaganili yo niivi, kandi nduuki kuhaana vihaanwa viukusambwa kandi vie mirembe ulalinda yo ku madiku saba kuduuka lwa nziza ku ivi kandi na ngovolere cha okola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Saolo yagirung'ana atuli ku Samweli, Nyasaye yaaha Saolo liiva lihia. Kandi vindu viosi via Samweli yamuvolera viekoleka lidiku yilio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Saolo nu mutumikiri weve vaduuka ha Gibea, muganda gwa avaporofeti gwagaana naye. Nonoho Roho wa Nyasaye yaza kuye nizinguru, kandi yahambana navo mu liporofeta liavo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa vandu vaali nivamanya Saolo ku maziambiri, vamulola kuli yaporofetaa navaporofeti vateevana, “Ni ki chekoleki ku muyaayi wa Kishi? Saolo aveeye mulala ku muporofeti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu mulala wamenyanga yo, yateeva, “Na avaporofeti vandi yava vaveeye ndi, uganaganaa avababa vaavo ni vanga vwaha?” Nindio livoora yili liatanga, “Saolo aveeye mulala ku muporofeti?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa Saolo yamala liporofeta lilie yazia ku vwali ku kiguru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa mwavo baba wa Saolo yamulola numutumikiri weve, yamuteeva, “Muturaa hayi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saolo yativura, “Kwenya zibunda. Lwa kwavula kuzinyoola, kwazia kolola Samweli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amwavo baba wa Saolo yamuteeva, “Naye akovooleeye ki?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saolo yativura, “Akovooleeye ndi zibunda zinyoleki.” Navuzwa Saolo siyamuvolera aga Samweli yaali namuvooleye ku liigwa mwami lilie mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saolo akolangwa kuva mwami",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samweli yalanga vandu vosi vavugane harara imbiri wa Yahova ha Mizipa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "navavoolera, “Yahova, Nyasaye wa Isiraeli avoora, ‘Ndaamutuliza mu kivala cha Egebeti kandi nimuhonyia kutura ku vandu va Egebeti kandi ku vandu vandi vosi avaari nivamudambizaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzi mbeeye Nyasaye winyu, umuhonyiaa kutura mu kivi chienyu kandi mu vudinyu vwinyu vwosi, navuzwa kalunu, mumali kunyambakana kandi muteevi inzi muhe mwami. Vulahi ligali; kunangwa, mwivungize imbiri wa Yahova kolondekana ku zihiiri zienyu kandi ku miliango jinyu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maku Samweli yalaga vuli ihiiri ya Isiraeli vaze imbiri, na Yahova yatovola ihiiri ya Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Samweli yaleeta avizinyumba zia ihiiri ya Benjamini kuuza imbiri wa Yahova, na Yahova yatovola avinyumba ya matiri. Kandi avasaza vi inyumba ya Matiri vaza imbiri wa Yahova, na Saolo muyaayi wa Kishi yatovolwa. Vaamwenya navuzwa lwa vavura kumunyoola, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vateva Yahova, “Mundu wundi akakiri yo naho?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova yativura, “Saolo ngula, yiivisi inyima wi misigo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa vanyagura nivaleeta Saolo ku vandu. Lwa yasingira hagati ha vandu valora ndi aveeye mutambi ligali kuvita mundu wundi woosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
